  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Uturorero tw'ikode, ivyangombwa vya JSON, n'imfano z'amabwiriza asomwa n'imashini bifise uruhushya rwa MIT License, kiretse aho vyavuzwe ukundi. Urashobora kubishira ku mbuga zawe ku buntu.",
