  "Commercial use requires contact": "Ikoreshwa mu bucuruzi risaba kuvugana natwe",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Iryagenwe inyuma y'Umuhimbaro w'Umutekano w'Ikoranabwenge wo i Bletchley, riyobowe na Yoshua Bengio hamwe n'inzobere zirenga 100 zivuye mu bihugu bigana 30 hamwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye, OECD n'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi, iri ripori ryigenga rirunganya ivyabonetse mu bumenyi vy'ubu ku bushobozi n'akaga vy'ikoranabwenge gikomeye — rikavuga ko hariho sisitemu zimwe zibasha ubu kumenya igihe zisuzumwa kandi zikahindura ingeso zazo ukwabijanye.",
