  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Guhindura itangazo ry'uburenganzira kikaba isoko ry'uruhushya rikora, aho kuguma ku rubuga rw'ego-oya rufunze/rugaragara.",
  "Copied ✓": "Vyafashwe ✓",
