  "each level independently licensable & auditable": "buri ntambwe ishobora guhabwa uruhushya no kugenzurwa ku giti cayo",
  "embedding — vectorization and retrieval indexes": "embedding — gukora ivyuma vy'imibare no gushiraho urutonde rwo kuronka",
